      "id": "VERDICT-008",
      "title": "FRESHNESS: another ticket's verdict is refused even on the right path",
      "note": "A verdict is evidence only for the run that produced it \u2014 copying a clean one into place must not open the gate.",
      "files": [
        {
          "base": "ticket",
          "path": "phases/code/iter-1-verdict.json",
          "fixture": "verdict/stale-ticket.json"
